        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Rav baansyam guay ^&8 thuanc diu, Alleluia!",
            "Ringhpouc hym daihmei sw diu ,Alleluia!",
            "Suan o, he kauh lev dihle, Alleluia!",
            "’Niu Racguangc hei Guangh kiu e, Alleluia!",
            "",
            "2 Thuanc o, he tingkauh mei guay, Alleluia!",
            "Taek makna zianmeipu e, Alleluia!",
            "Bw lev Neihle, kauc ranv o, Alleluia!",
            "Zingbangc Gaanchuangc neihlaa o, Alleluia!",
            "",
            "3 Ringhpouc khang ’dow bammei nunc,Alleluia!",
            "Ravmundinhmei muhzwng nunc, Alleluia!",
            "Thyamra, ramh thiak thaymei nunc, Alleluia!",
            "Lu hei kaniw lay suan e, Alleluia!",
            "",
            "4 Alauc, gaanthauh, puipu guay, Alleluia!",
            "Lu hei kauc ranvna suan o, Alleluia!",
            "Alauc nunc ni neihlaana, Alleluia!",
            "Kalum khou kadam laa diu, Alleluia!"
          ]
        }
